WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.880
Follow the loop!

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:04.107
It curls above the stream, then rolls toward the far bank.

00:00:04.107 --> 00:00:05.867
Keep your eye on the fly.

00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:07.041
The mountains slide past.

00:00:07.041 --> 00:00:08.215
The line stretches out.

00:00:08.215 --> 00:00:08.801
Almost there.

00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:10.562
A tiny touch on the water.

00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:11.735
Now look below it.

00:00:11.735 --> 00:00:12.909
A trout turns upward.

00:00:12.909 --> 00:00:13.789
There it goes!

00:00:13.789 --> 00:00:14.669
One bright leap.

00:00:14.669 --> 00:00:15.549
What a rise!
